<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Farallon cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Farallon cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co said it downgraded Farallon Communications Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- Late Thursday, Farallon reported a second quarter loss of $0.04 per share.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 3/8 to 3-7/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
